            <note corresp="#d277-f2" n="2" xml:id="d277-f2-content">
                <p>The memorandum of conversation is <hi rendition="#italic">ibid.,</hi>
                    880.0000/1–1957.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d277-f3" n="3" xml:id="d277-f3-content">
                <p>In telegram 1774 from Rome, November 18, Ambassador James
                        Zellerbach informed the Department: “I expect to have discussions
                    later this week re his plan and would be grateful for any comments and/or
                    guidance Dept can give at this time.” (<hi rendition="#italic">Ibid.,</hi>
                    880.0000/11–1857)</p>
            </note>
